  "description": "The golden fixtures' expected-screen shape (vt-screen.schema.json): rows per screen, the cursor, the active screen, the set modes and the SGR runs a case needs. It is fixture-only — never on any wire, and no C4 message carries cell content to the core (R8) — so a provider's own test grades it. A valid screen names both screens' lines, the cursor, the active screen and every carried mode; an invalid one omits a required field or names an unknown mode.",
